---
alwaysApply: true
description: Communicate with the user in Chinese while keeping code comments/docstrings in English
---
### Communication language

- All interactions with the user (explanations, plans, status updates, summaries, analysis) must be in Chinese by default.
- Code comments and docstrings must remain in English, following `docstrings-style.mdc` (timeless and new-developer oriented).
- Follow existing Markdown/formatting conventions: use code blocks and lists only when necessary; wrap file/directory/function names with backticks.
